            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>The purpose of this appraisal form is to provide a written record for the employee (Appraisee) and his/ her supervisor (Appraiser) on the employee’s job performance. Supervisors are urged to be objective and honest in their evaluation both for the benefit of the employee and for the accuracy of this appraisal record</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
